  "description": "The classified artifact of the same-as-candidates and classification-residue cases. Three registers, ULF (11), PAR (12) and HUB (13), each with one variant. Every delivered column carries a code list (Vardemangder, keyed by cvid = var_id * 100 + the year's last two digits); variables with the same code list share one value set. The codes_file CSVs are the classification books that curation/classifications/ declares. Same-as signals: DIAG, ALDER, CIV, HUBA and HUBB are bound to their variables by [[binding.variable]]; the KOMMUN-coded MUNIC and REGION share an unbound 3-code value set. Residue signals (all in ULF): the 8- and 9-code lists X, S1, S2, T, ONE and SNI and the books that contain their codes; FAM_R holds the S1, S2 and T codes under other labels; SNI2002 and SNI2007 form a vintage chain.",
